  "shortDescription": {
    "en": "The book names a suspected transformation that familiar categories only partly capture. An AI-generated text may contain no obvious falsehood, display no average directional bias, and remain professionally balanced while weakening decisive contrasts, causal relations, agency, uncertainty, affected parties, or consequences.",
